## Delete record

If you’re a fan of the TV show *Suits*, you’ll know that Donna is not a lawyer. Let’s remove her from the table.

::: {#4f73912b .cell execution_count=2}
``` {.python .cell-code}
df.remove(pl.col('Student') == 'Donna')
```

